    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/travel-itinerary-planning/1.mp3",
      "text": "Since summer holiday is beginning soon, let us travel somewhere peaceful this Saturday.",
      "textSha256": "8a095e7ac9cbff7a19f0449bec4f697c6e317cef642788aef3a33decd7c6dc2c"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/travel-itinerary-planning/2.mp3",
      "text": "Do you want to explore an old historic town or walk through the quiet country hills?",
      "textSha256": "92f5e59378a32f0ad425f92bcb53c3d2fc5fc4c75bd5c833c86bf761fda0ae82"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/travel-itinerary-planning/3.mp3",
      "text": "A walking tour through the mountain country would give us a breath of fresh life.",
      "textSha256": "06693bbf74b225f050161d19edea9d32655125f5e646b497fc46869ad1c2dd06"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/travel-itinerary-planning/4.mp3",
      "text": "Is the scenic waterfall view really worth the two-hour train ride?",
      "textSha256": "f41499c0aa57c2a51225edcea2152b9b2739ac425f4e72217bdd09e9071a7cd5"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/travel-itinerary-planning/5.mp3",
      "text": "It is definitely worth the trip because the forest nature trails are breathtaking.",
      "textSha256": "c388df6163a5627742889b2972876b5fa2b660c1bb11406f0cd4bc40f9fc4784"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/travel-itinerary-planning/6.mp3",
      "text": "Let us pack simple sandwiches and visit the local tea farm in the afternoon.",
      "textSha256": "c2808982f3b9a99b0251f25ff921634b0c291309c7756df064969ebc4df7a0fd"
    },
    {
